---
const ids = [
  ['1249480', 'Ex-Zodiac'],
  ['3124230', 'Jackal'],
  ['1662480', 'Nuclear Blaze'],
  ['1181610', 'Roto Force'],
  ['266210', '片道勇者'],
  ['2132850', 'Rabbit and Steel'],
];
---
<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>HARF-WAY Sale Image Proxy Preview</title>
    <style>
      :root { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; background:#f8f6f0; color:#181818; }
      body { margin:0; padding:32px; }
      main { max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; }
      h1 { font-size:28px; font-weight:600; }
      p { color:#77736b; }
      .grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:12px; }
      article { border:1px solid #d6d0c5; background:#fffefa; }
      img { display:block; width:100%; aspect-ratio:460/215; object-fit:cover; background:#ddd; }
      div { padding:12px; }
      code { font-size:12px; }
      @media(max-width:760px){ .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>SALE WATCH / IMAGE PROXY PREVIEW</h1>
      <p>6枚すべて表示されれば、Steam画像をVercel経由で配信できています。</p>
      <section class="grid">
        {ids.map(([appid, title]) => (
          <article>
            <img src={`/api/sale-image-public?appid=${appid}`} alt={title} />
            <div><strong>{title}</strong><br/><code>{appid}</code></div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
